*> PLB-K008 cics-name-too-long: a CICS resource named with a literal
*> longer than names of its kind are.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. NAMELEN.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-COMMAREA         PIC X(100).
01  WS-REC              PIC X(80).
01  WS-RESP             PIC S9(8) COMP.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Reported: 5, 9, 9, 8, and 8 characters.
    EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('ACCTU') COMMAREA(WS-COMMAREA) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('COACTUPDC') COMMAREA(WS-COMMAREA)
    END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS READ FILE('ACCTDATAF') INTO(WS-REC) RIDFLD(WS-REC)
        RESP(WS-RESP)
    END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS SEND MAP('COACTUPA') MAPSET('COACTUPS') ERASE
    END-EXEC
    *> Fine: names within their lengths, trailing spaces.
    EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('CAUP') COMMAREA(WS-COMMAREA) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('COACTUPC') END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS READ DATASET('ACCTDAT ') INTO(WS-REC) RIDFLD(WS-REC)
        RESP(WS-RESP)
    END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS SEND MAP('CACTUPA') MAPSET('COACTUP') END-EXEC
    GOBACK.
